        "Content": "**2/3 BEDROOM BUNGALOW ON C.0.4 ACRES**\r\n\r\nKillian Lynch auctioneers are pleased to offer this 2/3 bedroom bungalow on C.0.4 acres. The property which is situated on an elevated site with panoramic views is in need of renovation throughout, but should qualify for a renovation grant of up to €70,000. The property extends to C.800 sq ft living accommodation to include hall, kitchen, utility, sitting room, bathroom, 3 bedrooms. Located in a beautiful setting only C.1km from Dripsey village, C.5 minutes drive to Coachford and C.20 minutes drive from Cork city."
